Sales Ledger - Changelog
18/05/13 Vincent Coen	* Remapped all invoice & open item files to support link to
			  SC (Stock Control) when using Invoicing so that product
			  codes has 13 chars, descriptions has 32 chars.
			  Data entry will use SC if linked using stock code or abbrev
			  code or description. Search available on Stock code, Abrev
			  & description using function keys to instigate a search.
			  F3 = search on Abrev code display 1st with F2 for next record
			  F6 = search on description display 1st with F5 for next record.
			  Currently Invoice entry sl910 still allows manual item entry even
			  when stock is linked, must decide if this must be removed.!!!

